    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/e201dec13e6fac70820f2dbf314fac44.avif?t=1753507234\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/9437850018de4f4e09ea339106a438dd.avif?t=1753507234\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the paws of an adorable but mischievous pup! Left alone, this is your chance to explore, collect, and smash your way through 5 vibrant, interactive environments!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/7bf01680ef54a9eb5526270b439cfc97.poster.avif?t=1753507234\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/7bf01680ef54a9eb5526270b439cfc97.webm?t=1753507234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/7bf01680ef54a9eb5526270b439cfc97.mp4?t=1753507234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve puzzles and dig into a howl-arious list of fun-filled shenanigans in an attempt to impress your feathered friends, who reward you with \u2728Mischievous Badges\u2728</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's sure to be a pawsitively unforgettable day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/56fc5288d41a42583a265eedec6f85dd.avif?t=1753507234\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc36 Engaging single-player adventure </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf08 Vibrant 3D cartoon-style graphics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde6 14 adorable pawjama outfits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 Puzzles to solve using found items </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae 5 interactive environments <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/7b070d910be6362f1f295f513dc15249.poster.avif?t=1753507234\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/7b070d910be6362f1f295f513dc15249.webm?t=1753507234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/7b070d910be6362f1f295f513dc15249.mp4?t=1753507234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 100+ mischievous badges </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc26 5 feathered friends </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 You can pee everywhere! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Fun for all ages </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/b06e4766f95abb9d7112e10316eb6c06.poster.avif?t=1753507234\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/b06e4766f95abb9d7112e10316eb6c06.webm?t=1753507234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/b06e4766f95abb9d7112e10316eb6c06.mp4?t=1753507234\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the world through a dog's eyes in this game of exploration, problem-solving, and causing mischief. &quot;Doggy Don't Care&quot; is your invitation to unleash your inner pup!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/aa8c886bc64e11f87d592d4c0ef75476.poster.avif?t=1753507234\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/aa8c886bc64e11f87d592d4c0ef75476.webm?t=1753507234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the mailing list for updates and a chance to be a beta tester.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
