ideo></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the world through a dog's eyes in this game of exploration, problem-solving, and causing mischief. &quot;Doggy Don't Care&quot; is your invitation to unleash your inner pup!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/aa8c886bc64e11f87d592d4c0ef75476.poster.avif?t=1753507234\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2438180/extras/aa8c886bc64e11f87d592d4c0ef75476.webm?t=1753507234\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the mailing list for updates and a chance to be a beta tester.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Unleash adorable chaos, solve puzzles, and leave your mark (literally!) as a mischievous dog.",
