    "reviews": "\u201cThere\u2019s beauty in the basics, and sometimes the best experience can simply be existing as a little pug that messes a house up. That\u2019s the gist of Doggy Don\u2019t Care.\u201d<br>Kotaku AU<br><br>\u201cYou shouldn\u2019t sleep on Doggy Don\u2019t Care if you liked Untitled Goose Game\u201d<br>Tech Radar Gaming<br><br>\u201cDoggy Don\u2019t Care is an incredibly cute mischief sim. As a sandbox game, it\u2019s all about making your own fun while discovering each and every challenge on offer\u201d<br>Gameshub<br>",
